=email</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 15:24:45 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The microplastics thing is not really holding up]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1844016813878775808/sxsXZ4Xx_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Simon Maechling (@simonmaechling) on X</p><p>You’ve been told microplastics are everywhere. In your food.
